---
description: Account and Payments service (W1).
globs: services/account/**,ops/paystack/**
alwaysApply: false
---

See `services/account/AGENTS.md`.
- Only this service holds the Paystack secret and email key. Never log or move them.
- Verify `x-paystack-signature` (HMAC-SHA512) first; reject forged, ignore duplicates. Test mode only.
- No session without a consent record and an entitlement. Emails never contain scores.
